acceptance:
C2 (option parser, fail closed). claude_sed_tokens_are_read_only accepts only these exact options:
- -n, --quiet, --silent;
- -E, -r, --regexp-extended;
- -s, --separate;
- -z, --null-data;
- -u, --unbuffered;
- --posix, --debug, --sandbox;
- -e SCRIPT, -eSCRIPT, --expression=SCRIPT, --expression SCRIPT;
- short clusters of n E r s u z, optionally ending in e followed by its script;
- --, after which every word is a file.

Every script, whether given with -e, with --expression or as the first operand, goes through C1. Any other option is refused, including -i or -f inside a cluster, any abbreviation, and any option taking a value.
